          "evidence": "Authored module notes: Captures NoMachine user session profiles (.nxs files) from %USERPROFILE%\\Documents\\NoMachine. Excludes logs, lock files, temp files, and session recordings. .nxs files may embed saved credentials and are flagged warn-only in secrets. Confidence: medium - Documents\\NoMachine is the documented per-user profile directory; system-wide server config lives under %PROGRAMDATA%\\NoMachine and is excluded (not portable across machines). Authored secret warning: NoMachine .nxs session files may embed saved credentials (passwords or SSH key references). Review captured files before committing to a shared store. This module captures them but they must not be automatically restored on a new machine without user review. Authored excluded secret or machine-bound paths: %USERPROFILE%\\Documents\\NoMachine\\*.nxs"
